flowchart TD
    IN([From A2.0 complete]) --> GW1{Initial evaluation?}

    GW1 -->|Exam required| A3_0[A3.0 Exam required]
    GW1 -->|Exam exempted| A3_1[A3.1 Exam exempted]
    GW1 -->|Failed review| A3_2[A3.2 Not qualified]
    GW1 -->|Further screening only| A4_3[A4.3 Further evaluation]

    A3_0 --> A4_0[A4.0 Exam taken]
    A3_0 --> A4_1[A4.1 Exam pending]
    A3_0 --> A4_2[A4.2 Not qualified - no exam]
    A4_1 --> A4_0
    A4_1 --> A4_2
    A4_0 --> A4_3

    A3_1 --> GW2{Admission decision}
    A4_0 --> GW2
    A4_3 --> GW2

    GW2 -->|Within cutoff| A5_0[A5.0 Offered]
    GW2 -->|Probationary| A5_1[A5.1 Offered - probationary]
    GW2 -->|Redirected| A5_2[A5.2 Offered - redirected]
    GW2 -->|Waitlisted| A5_3[A5.3 Waitlisted]
    GW2 -->|Outside cutoff| A5_5[A5.5 Not qualified]

    A5_3 -->|Slot opened| A5_0

    A3_2 --> END1([Terminal])
    A4_2 --> END1
    A5_5 --> END1
